From b15d913143ea963f447d302816ee169e1aec8df5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: issakakar <Issakakar@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 09:45:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] test(editor): spatial index parity fuzz, micro benchmark
 and in-app timings

- ShapeSpatialIndex.test.ts: random churn checked against a brute-force scan
  and against rbush on every step, plus structural validate(), slot recycling,
  nested queries, generation wrap and bulk load.
- internal/scripts/spatial-bench: one implementation per process, driven the
  way SpatialIndexManager drives it, over uniform (rbush's own shape) and
  whiteboard-shaped data.
- spatialIndexPerf.test.ts: opt-in end-to-end timings for cull, drag and hit
  test through the public Editor API, so the same file runs on either index.
